   "en": "Three friends shop at the same market. The first buys 4 kg onions, 3 kg wheat and 2 kg rice for ₹270; the second buys 2 kg onions, 4 kg wheat and 6 kg rice for ₹460; the third buys 6 kg onions, 2 kg wheat and 3 kg rice for ₹330. Taking x, y, z as the prices per kg of onions, wheat and rice, they write the purchases as AX = B and solve it by the matrix method."
  },
  "stem": {
   "en": "What is the determinant of the coefficient matrix A?"
  },
