   "en": "|A| = 4(4·3 − 6·2) − 3(2·3 − 6·6) + 2(2·2 − 4·6) = 4(0) − 3(−30) + 2(−20) = 90 − 40 = 50. Because |A| ≠ 0, the system has a unique solution X = A⁻¹B."
  },
